<title>UK: CAP reform must accompany EU expansion-UK's Blair.</title>
<headline>CAP reform must accompany EU expansion-UK's Blair.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Tony Blair on Wednesday called the European Union's Common Agricultural Policy(CAP)&quot;a disgrace&quot; and said its reform must accompany any moves to enlarge the Community.</p>
<p>&quot;It is a disgrace in the way it works at the moment and should be reformed in the interests of all of the people of Europe,&quot; Blair said at Prime Minister's question time in parliament.</p>
</text>
